{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：16:27 2026-11-28 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"馬主鍾國良等人沽淺水灣複式 作價1.18億元 持貨21年升值1.58倍\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0551d362d64d8f610b92bfc21e55fb9b/2026-11/20261128_FIN__.png\"/>\n<p>港島南區豪宅市場再添一宗億元級買賣。淺水灣道56號的單號屋，近期以1.18億元易手，面積約2550方呎，呎價約46,275元，原業主包括資深馬主鍾國良及相關人士。</p>\n<img alt=\"資深馬主鍾國良(右二)沽淺水灣道56號單號屋，作價1.18億元。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7cbe10023425b24684d6275d40c9a94c/2026-11/a50dba4e-abb8-4d1c-91e9-29cec7a050b9.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/32fdf0b44afde4dffbadbb77e51580e5/2026-11/bd45d28d-51cf-4828-ad85-8aecbda4d778.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6af1de9cca69297739ce0e394290455f/2026-11/PE261008RB058_1__1.jpg\"/>\n<p>​資料顯示，上述成交複式單位面積達2,550平方呎。原業主為霸威有限公司（BARWILL LIMITED），其董事為本港資深馬主鍾國良，他過往名下曾擁有高達7匹賽駒，當中多匹均以「鑽」字命名。</p>\n<p>​鍾氏早於2005年以4,571.5萬元購入該物業，持貨長達21年，是次轉手帳面大幅獲利約7,228.5萬元，期內物業升值約1.58倍。</p>\n<p>據悉，新買家為一間非本地註冊公司（CHANCE MASTER HK LIMITED）。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T09:56:53.343827+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":4,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T08:27:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T09:50:30.116522+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T09:50:30.116522+00:00","content_hash":"7bfb4f2bb7f74859d1791c7c4c27a8fda67c38a29b917a2b83db5b5ea2204650","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}